# BRO-205: does sys_futex ever return a glibc-fatal errno (EFAULT/EINVAL) for a
# FUTEX_WAIT on a valid word under heavy page-table churn? (Reproduces the
# "futex facility returned an unexpected error code" abort seen under mesa
# llvmpipe.) Watch serial for BD_FUTEX and FUTEXSTRESS: PASS/FAIL.
run /boot/BIN/FUTEXSTRESS
